        "Straightforward accountancy for Exeter's sole traders and small companies.",
        "Marsh and Webb is a two-partner practice based in the city centre, built around fixed fees, plain-English advice, and actually answering the phone. We handle the numbers so you can get on with running your business.",
        "Chartered Accountants · Exeter"
      ]
