      "text": [
        "Accountancy services built for small business",
        "From your first self-assessment to full management accounts, we cover the essentials well rather than trying to be everything to everyone.",
        "Annual accounts",
        "Statutory and management accounts prepared on time, checked properly, and explained in a call — not just emailed over.",
        "Self-assessment",
        "Personal tax returns for sole traders, landlords and directors, with reminders well before the January rush.",
        "Company tax & Corporation Tax",
        "CT600 preparation and filing, plus year-round advice on allowances and reliefs you're entitled to claim.",
        "Bookkeeping & VAT",
        "Monthly or quarterly bookkeeping using Xero or QuickBooks, with MTD-compliant VAT returns filed for you.",
        "Payroll",
        "Weekly or monthly payroll runs, payslips, and pension auto-enrolment handled for teams of any size.",
        "Company formation & start-up advice",
        "Thinking of going limited? We'll talk you through the structure, register the company, and get your bookkeeping set up from day one.",
        "What we do"
      ]
    },
